 "verdict": "Of 72 novel (drug x disease) pairs, 18 carry a mechanically-verified in-disease registered trial. The §5.4 contrast is decisive and EMPIRICAL: the SPECIFIC stratum (16/25) is investigationally live while the BROAD generic-chaperone stratum (2/47) is largely a structural artifact -- an enrichment of ~15.0x. Each hit is a CORRECTLY-LABELLED novel lead (V8 novel|approved-indication=0); an in-disease trial corroborates its plausibility as an investigational direction, never that it works. The 54 no-signal pairs are flagged structural [O] hypotheses, down-weighted not refuted. With direction-recovery (V3-V7), exclusion-calibration (V10) and now novelty (V11), the §5.3 four-metric ledger is complete in-house; only PROSPECTIVE falsification (external) remains.",
